WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.970
Part fourteen: no-show decisions. Decide each no-show a stand lead reported: no call no show, excused, or they actually worked.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.509
Hub tools shows how many no-shows are waiting.

00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:15.900
Tap No-show decisions.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:25.156
No call, no show counts toward the limit for the year, and emails the person. Excused never counts. Mistake means they did work.

00:00:25.356 --> 00:00:30.910
Each no-show: who, the stand and date, who reported it, and the stand lead's note.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.686
Parker never called. Pick NCNS, for no call, no show.

00:00:35.886 --> 00:00:40.303
Rowan texted the lead about a sick kid. Pick Excused, and add a note.

00:00:40.503 --> 00:00:46.178
The preview says exactly what will happen: who gets the email, and if anyone reaches the limit.

00:00:46.378 --> 00:00:49.760
Tap Record these decisions, then tap again.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:58.170
Recorded. The count is updated, the email went out, and anyone who reached the limit would be paused automatically.
